  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;is an even prime number, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;is a divisor of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>:</mo></math> the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCF</mi></math>&nbsp;of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>, then which of the following is correct?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>r</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>p</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Since, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;is an even prime number,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;is a divisor of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math> and</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>:</mo></math> the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCF</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>.</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is correct.</p><p>Hence, option (d) is correct.</p>"
  }
